# AI Secretary — Feature Walkthrough

The AI Secretary is now a fully context-aware agent with high observability.

## 1. Vivid Terminal Observability 🌈
The terminal now "shouts" in color every time the bot performs an action:
- **`[LISTEN]` (Cyan)**: Message received from Telegram.
- **`[THINKING]` (Yellow)**: AI is analyzing and planning.
- **`[TOOL CALL]` (Magenta)**: AI is using a tool (Outlook, PDF, etc.).
- **`[REPLY]` (Green)**: Final answer sent back to you.

## 2. Conversation Memory 🧠
The bot now has **Short-term Memory**. It remembers the last **10 messages** in your conversation (persisted in `.tmp/chat_histories/`).

**Try this follow-up test:**
1. **User**: "What was the last email I received?"
2. **User**: "Summarize it for me in 2 bullet points."
   *(The bot will remember which email you're talking about!)*

## 3. Transparency & Tracing 🔍
Use the **/trace** command in Telegram at any time to get a full report of the AI's "thought process" for the last request, including exactly which tools it called and how many tokens it used.

## 4. How to Run
1. Run `python main.py`.
2. Open Telegram and start chatting!
